<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov crude imports up 1.6 pct yr/yr -- MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov crude imports up 1.6 pct yr/yr -- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Wednesday issued the following data on crude oil imports during November 1996:</p>
<p> CRUDE OIL   (1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Iran	   3,083	 19,392    + 2.7    + 5.9</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 4,535	 28,525    + 2.4    +17.1</p>
<p> Kuwait	 1,266	  7,963    + 1.9    -11.0</p>
<p> Neutral Zone 1,112	  6,994    +14.4    + 9.8</p>
<p> Qatar	    775	  4,875    -47.8    -51.6</p>
<p> Oman	   1,105	  6,950    -29.5    + 1.1</p>
<p> UAE	    6,566	 41,300    +10.2    + 9.8</p>
<p> Yemen	     49	    308    -64.4    -81.3</p>
<p> China	    943	  5,931    - 2.2    -23.2</p>
<p> Malaysia	 343	  2,157    +35.3    +17.6</p>
<p> Brunei	   263	  1,654   +347.7    - 8.7</p>
<p> Indonesia    1,069	  6,724    -17.4    -40.9</p>
<p> Vietnam	  510	  3,208    +18.8    +42.8</p>
<p> Mexico	   567	  3,566    + 1.0    +95.7</p>
<p> Australia	302	  1,900   +160.3    178.4</p>
<p> TOTAL	 22,488	141,447    + 2.3    + 1.6</p>
<p>--Tokyo Energy Desk (81-3-5473-3708)</p>
</text>
